      "boostsAttacks": true,
      "notes": [
        "While grounded or rooted, Rengar loses the enhanced attack range from Unseen Predator.",
        "Rengar can freely use any abilities, summoner spells, or item actives while leaping.\n  - Using a dash or blink ability will interrupt the leap.",
        "The attack from the leap will:\n  - Not go off if the dash was interrupted.\n  - Not go off if the target becomes untargetable.\n  - Go off at the end of the dash even if its normal destination is obstructed by boundaries he cannot cross (e.g. terrain, The Hextech Ultimatum).\n  - Go off regardless of distance the enemy travels away from Rengar's original location.\n  - Go off even if Rengar loses sight of the target."
      ]
