      "notes": [
        "The ability applies a mark on the target at the start of attack windup that is successively consumed when the basic attack hits to apply the effect.\n  - If the attack is prevented or blocked (e.g. by knocking down Rengar when leaping) then the effect will not be applied.\n    - The mark will however still linger for a very short period after that, allowing Rengar to consume it with a quick basic attack. [https://github.com/ArdaSenyurek/Rengar-Bugs/issues/108]",
